        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0c804787-93f3-49e4-8f11-f445f5b35737).Image",
        "Description": "Ikkei Andou, Masumi Okamoto, and Hanna Olsen have been marked for elimination after their involvement in a criminal organization that has operated above the law for years. An anonymous client has hired a mysterious assassin to bring their operation to an end. Your mission is to infiltrate undetected, eliminate all three targets, and disappear without a trace. A true ninja strikes from the shadows, relying on stealth, patience, and the deadly precision of a katana.",
